{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And I answer:</b> שבלים is feminine, like נשים פילגשים." "<b>And I say:</b> Also ask about the two ears of grain that were cut from the two olive trees that empty upon them — they are the pipes into which the olives were pressed, and they empty from them the good, pure oil like poured gold into the bowl, and in the bowl are molds from which the oil is poured to the lamps that are upon the top of the lampstand."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:45:59.814436342Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}